# New scenes (upstream has none): the screen's links and what each
# navigation's badges say.
# a cold load into the gallery: the log's first entry is a cold load that
# enters the gallery, and the catalog hangs after 600 ms
@0 open /gallery
@600 link Dawn Over the Harbor
# the painting's own links: Next and Previous stay on the route
@1000 link Next →
@1400 link ← Previous
# back to the gallery: a fresh entry loads the catalog again
@1800 link ← Back to Gallery
# a painting the gallery does not have, and its link back
@2400 open /gallery/7
@2800 link ← Back to Gallery
# a path the site does not have, and its link home
@3400 open /missing
@3500 link ← Go Home
# the browser's Back returns to the page before, which is entered again
@3600 back
@3700 end
